      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this superb two bedroom, two bathroom apartment on Lower Kilmacud Road, Stillorgan. Offering bright, spacious accommodation along with the added benefit of a private car garage and balcony, this property is ideal for someone looking for a well-connected south Dublin base.\n\nThe apartment is bright and spacious throughout, featuring an open-plan kitchen, living and dining area leading to a large private balcony. There are two well-proportioned bedrooms & two bathrooms including one ensuite. The apartment also benefits a rare addition of a private car garage with private access to the building.\n\nIn terms of location, Stillorgan is a highly sought-after and well-connected suburb, offering excellent accessibility to Dublin city centre. The area is serviced by various Dublin Bus routes and is a 5 minute drive to Kilmacud Luas Stop or a 10 minute drive to Blockrock DART station, providing a fast and direct commute into town. There is also a wide range of local amenities and attractions, all within easy reach, making this an excellent location for city access combined with suburban convenience.\n\n1. Two double bedrooms\n2. Two bathrooms incl. ensuite\n3. Open-plan kitchen, living and dining area\n4. Private balcony\n5. Private car garage\n6. Excellent access to Dublin city centre\n7. 5 min drive to the Luas\n8. 10 min drive to the Dart\n9. All amenities nearby\n\nAvailable Immediately!\n\nENQUIRIES BY EMAIL ONLY PLEASE."
      },
